    "message": "Add joint photon blocks and delayed GPU click compression\n\nImplement C++ fixed-total joint photon tails and independent CPU/GPU direct click block laws. Verify complete small laws, high-input bias and explicit allocated capacity; publish all 87 setup-inclusive timing panels.\n\nPreserve large pure-PNR block errors and the old sampler accuracy advantage at equal GPU capacity. Frugal raw timing ratios do not imply equal quality.\n\nValidation: 1916 independent checks; 927 tests run, 898 passed, zero failures/errors; fifteen new interface tests.",
